# Topical Authority Map Generator

## Stack

- **Backend:** FastAPI (`backend/app/main.py`) exposing `POST /api/generate-topical-map`
- **LLM:** `google-genai` SDK with `gemini-2.5-flash` and Pydantic `response_schema` for structured JSON
- **Env:** `GEMINI_API_KEY` (same name used by other abcGEO tools)
- **Frontend:** Vanilla JS + D3.js v7 (no framework)
- **Exports:** PNG / SVG / CSV from the generator UI; PDF via existing `js/topicalAuthorityMapPdf.js` (`window.abcgeoExportTamPdf`)

